* TinyFan2350 v1.2 power paths: five 0.6 A fans on VIN (24 V), LED1 and LED2 on 5 V at 1.2 A each
* Every resistor named R<net>_<n> is one copper segment taken from the board file (1 oz copper, 20 C).
* The copper is the same in v1.1 and v1.2. Loads are ideal current sinks; fuses and contacts are resistors.
* RTERM = screw terminal, RFUSE + RHOLD = blade fuse and holder, RJ* = jumper shunt, RC* = JST contact.

* --- device models (fitted to the datasheet figures, see notes in the report) ---
* AO3400A: RDS(on) 28 mOhm at VGS 4.5 V, about 50 mOhm at 2.5 V; Ciss 630 pF, Coss 75 pF, Crss 50 pF
.model AO3400A NMOS (LEVEL=1 VTO=0.9 KP=15.4 RD=6m RS=4m CGSO=580n CGDO=50n CBD=60p IS=1e-12 PB=0.8 MJ=0.4 W=1m L=1m)
* 2N7002: Vth about 1.8 V, about 3 Ohm at VGS 4.5 V
.model N2N7002 NMOS (LEVEL=1 VTO=1.8 KP=0.17 RD=1 RS=0.3 CGSO=22n CGDO=5n CBD=15p W=1m L=1m)
.model DB5819 D (IS=31.7u RS=0.051 N=1.373 CJO=110p M=0.35 EG=0.69 XTI=2 BV=40 IBV=1m TT=5n)
.model D1N4148 D (IS=2.52n RS=0.568 N=1.752 CJO=4p M=0.4 TT=20n BV=100 IBV=100u)
.model DSS54 D (IS=20u RS=0.02 N=1.1 CJO=500p M=0.4 EG=0.69 XTI=2 BV=40 IBV=1m)

